<title>ITALY: CYCLING-ITALY'S CIPOLLINI WINS FIRST STAGE OF GIRO.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ITALY'S CIPOLLINI WINS FIRST STAGE OF GIRO.</headline>
<dateline>VENICE, Italy 1997-05-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mario Cipollini of Italy won the 128-km first stage of the Giro d'Italia cycle race on Saturday, according to provisional results.</p>
</text>
